cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "iiif-photoalbum"
abstract: >-
  Generates IIIF Presentation API 3.0 Manifests and Collections for photo
  albums digitised in layers (pages with and without protective interleaf,
  inserts, cords, loose photographs). Curators list the images of an album in
  a spreadsheet, pointing to images already served by a IIIF image server or
  as plain files; the tool measures the images, groups them into pages with
  switchable layers, warns about layers whose size or shape differ, validates
  the result and writes static JSON files that can be published on GitHub
  Pages or any web server. The photo albums SGV_10A_00031 and SGV_10A_00050 of
  the SGV_10 Kreis Family Collection serve as examples.
